id: mimicry-of-penetrating-fangs
name: Mimicry of Penetrating Fangs
order: 6
description: >
  Though your own bite is less than fearsome, you can emulate the bite of a fearsome predator thanks to your tools and/or ingenuity.
text: >
  Mimicry of Penetrating Fangs: Though your own bite is less than fearsome, you can emulate the bite of a fearsome predator thanks to your tools and/or ingenuity.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Strike Rolls by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you target an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, that Attacking Maneuver ignores 1/4 (rounded up) of your Opponent’s Soak Value if it hits.

---

[passive]
# (1)
strike += 1(T);
# (2) Asked as an attack at an Opponent is declared, once a Round: a quarter of their Soak Value ignored, rounded up (chat.mjs).
allow pseudoFangs.pierce;
